[{"client_msg_id":"900ebb55-ada4-435a-8e1a-f2c1113e5aa2","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"日本語入力ならたぶん kitty?","ts":"1620907396.319100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"108dff37-356c-42f9-86f9-e8aae0634dca","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1620887717.318600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hgKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0f42d55-1e13-4602-8be2-99021bb7928b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/windowslinuxlinuxebpfwindows.html\u003e","ts":"1620887715.318300","attachments":[{"fallback":"WindowsがまたLinuxを取り込む。マイクロソフト、Linuxカーネルが備える拡張機能「eBPF」互換機能をWindowsにもオープンソースで実装へ","id":1,"title":"WindowsがまたLinuxを取り込む。マイクロソフト、Linuxカーネルが備える拡張機能「eBPF」互換機能をWindowsにもオープンソースで実装へ","title_link":"https://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/windowslinuxlinuxebpfwindows.html","text":"マイクロソフトは、Linuxカーネルが備えている拡張機能である「eBPF」の互換機能を、Windows 10とWindows Server 2016以降で実現するオープンソース「eBPF for Windows」を発表しました。 カーネ...","image_url":"https://www.publickey1.jp/2021/ebpf4win01.gif","blocks":null,"service_name":"publickey1.jp","service_icon":"https://www.publickey1.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/windowslinuxlinuxebpfwindows.html","original_url":"https://www.publickey1.jp/blog/21/windowslinuxlinuxebpfwindows.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Wqm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dfc613e-a212-4a88-a2ff-6da2d5440c63","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"無駄なメニュー出てるのが気に入らないのでTermite(VTE使ってるやつ)とかAlacritty推し","ts":"1620881129.318000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PGCz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"237cf55f-2ab3-4217-a8d6-a5eec224a624","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://developer.gnome.org/vte/unstable/\u003e\nVTE はこれですね\nGnome terminal の裏側の API みたいなもんですかね\nこれを使ってるやつらは多少の機能の差異はあれど、基本的な機能が共通してるので取り回しやすいと思います\n// 試してないですが、設定とかも共有できるんじゃないですかね","ts":"1620880210.317800","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1620880236.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nct"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af20d412-b6b7-4932-b625-e725751771f4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7/%E3%83%A6%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3#.E3.82.BF.E3.83.BC.E3.83.9F.E3.83.8A.E3.83.AB.E3.82.A8.E3.83.9F.E3.83.A5.E3.83.AC.E3.83.BC.E3.82.BF|https://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B1%E3%83%BC%E3%[…]%83%A6%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3\u003e\nあ、肝心の URL 貼り忘れました","ts":"1620879990.316000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jNme"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3d24fbd-5632-49e8-a232-2df311fa8cee","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"vteというのはなんらかの規格ですか","ts":"1620879968.315600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3590a63-dc8d-421a-8fc2-807b18149c6b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まずは VTE に乗るか乗らないかを決めて、乗らないなら機能と見た目で選択ですね\n乗るならまぁどれ選んでもそこまで困らないと思います","ts":"1620879831.315500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75a61d30-7657-4316-b2c7-760d57ab34bf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえず入れてみたので気にしてなかったけどクロスプラットフォームなのは重要そう…","ts":"1620879161.314600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d56b1780-b373-41a5-a79d-49bffa19ed68","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"GPUちゃんと動いてんのか自信ないけど","ts":"1620879122.314500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ZB7s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd9f51b7-979f-4173-91df-4590dde8b734","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"tmux使うのでタブとかは要らないんですよね\n速さだけあれば","ts":"1620879109.314400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/kV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe4a49ad-03ed-42cb-934e-fbabe6db79fe","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"(あ、GPU使うやつがAlacrittyか。)","ts":"1620879096.314300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aCE8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b3a7a1c-40e4-4c25-97b5-7ffc169f5353","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"GPU使ってて、ちょっと速いとかだったら気になりますね。","ts":"1620879055.314100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uQb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fb60c9a-c8e3-4692-a75a-4d079b88efa6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ターミナル選ぶ基準って、ターミナルの機能で選ぶと思うんですが、ターミナル固有の機能に依存すると移植性が、、\n結局ターミナルエミュレータは普通のでいいかって感じですかね。","ts":"1620879010.313900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6CayV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f48cc961-534e-4b1c-adef-f7a5991e2659","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"意外とデフォルトも人気なんですね","ts":"1620878804.313700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T3N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b729ad49-eddb-47a9-8e6f-f48ba597e48b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"xfce4-terminal...","ts":"1620878735.313600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"khbC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf1f6100-4177-40a6-b4f7-ef0abe4f103b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"LinuxでもWindows Terminal使いたいなとか考えてるマン","ts":"1620878512.313400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"abR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b14568e8-53c1-463d-950b-ed0c7752685b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"クロスプラットフォームで設定を使い回せるのがAlacrittyの利点といえば利点ですかね","ts":"1620877175.311500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"roZp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12463d43-c21e-47e4-b6a4-695a4d65b7b0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"何かしらのDE使ってるならそれの標準でいい気はする","ts":"1620877127.311000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hkB0n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64fa6848-dba9-42cd-ad4a-b7a7bfa95932","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"昔はurxvt使ってたりしたけどセットアップの利便性を重視して僕もgnome terminalでやってます","ts":"1620877118.310700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eTGV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b5e760f-542b-432e-ae7b-23485663fa73","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"gnome terminal で十分だと思ってるマン…","ts":"1620877088.310200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ude"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f0e04e5-1925-4280-9874-bd569bda64bd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえずalacrittyを入れました（ロゴで決めた）","ts":"1620877060.309700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uxt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cc250f8-1618-4204-a516-0e2cd50a64cf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ようやく重い腰をあげて自宅PCがubuntuになったんですが\nターミナルエミュレータでオススメあったら教えて下さい","ts":"1620877046.309600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ss5q"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01D9BALE